1 polymer     man 'Papain-like protease nsp3' 35657.449 1   3.2.2.-,3.4.19.12,3.4.22.- C111S ? 
;SARS-CoV-2 papain-like protease (PLpro) catalytic domain (nsp3 residues 746-1059) carrying the catalytic C111S substitution. The protein was expressed in E. coli and purified following removal of the N-terminal 6X His-tag for crystallization.
